advanced.description:
{Advanced Summon Enchanters}

Summons Enchanters to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Enchanters summoned is 50% greater than Basic Summon Enchanters.

expert.description:
{Expert Summon Enchanters}

Summons Enchanters to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Enchanters summoned is 100% greater than Basic Summon Enchanters.
